        "filename": "Koxinga, 2 cash, Yong Li Tong Bao, seal script.jpg",
        "caption": "Coin (called Cash or Wen) from the rebel ruler Koxinga who was based in his Kingdom of Tungning which ruled the island of Taiwan. The coin reads \"Yong Li Tong Bao\" in seal script and was minted from 1651 to 1662 by Japanese casters in Nagasaki to support Koxinga's resistance against the Qing. This example is on Zeno.ru as #328992 with further details and exact metrics.",
